          <input type="password" id="setting-cf-token" placeholder="留空则通过 Worker 网关拉取（管理员自动下发）" class="w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 font-mono text-xs outline-none focus:border-[var(--primary)]" />
          <p class="text-[11px] text-black/40 dark:text-white/40 mt-1">管理员登录态下自动随耀西统一认证中心下发，无需手动填写喵~</p>
